      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is only the case if you have an UdonBehavior with Synchronize Position enabled - Errors will stop being thrown when the object is no longer held. \nYou can recreate this easily by just creating a pickup object, throwing an empty UdonBehavior on it, and turning Synchronize Position on. \nYou will now get errors.",
