  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When you hold/move(?) a gameObject with the VRC_Pickup component (see comment for more), it will spam the log with \"Error - [FlatBufferNetworkSerializer] Received OnEvent for the wrong view\"\n\nOnce you stop holding/moving(?) it, the errors will stop.\n\nTest World: wrld_ff39def8-c0b9-48a3-bcf6-658931821153\n\nLeft side has a few primitives you can pick up.",
